<div class="blog-article">

<p class="intro">On the first day of the twelfth month — just weeks from now — a total lunar eclipse will turn the full moon blood-red. The keseh will become blood. For those who know what Scripture says about this date, this moon, and this year, the convergence is difficult to dismiss.</p>

